      "prompt": "PRESS E TO READ",
      "dialog": "\"A NATURAL HISTORY OF THE SPORE SEAS\", ALL NINE VOLUMES, UNCUT. A PRESSED KELP-FLOWER FALLS OUT OF THE FIRST ONE."
